      "sha256": "da32ede5bf5ad3e49bcfe7001f52ad9ca15f7b3c923b610db83f04795739dd1b",
      "canonical_text": "For ten years, Mara had allowed Echo to learn from almost every private part of her life. It had studied old videos, private messages, voice notes, and memories from her sleep band. It knew which songs she played when nobody was home. It knew how long she stayed near a piano in shop windows.",
